{"title": "ICE agents shoot man in New York City with child present", "summary": "Immigration and Customs Enforcement (ICE) agents shot a man in New York City while a 5-year-old child was present in the vehicle, according to Mayor Eric Adams. The incident occurred in Marble Hill. The mayor has vowed action and called for ICE to be withdrawn from the city, stating \"We want them out.\" He has also contacted President Trump regarding the matter. The identity of the man shot has been reported as Oscar Belgal.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "बच्चे की मौजूदगी में न्यूयॉर्क शहर में ICE एजेंटों ने व्यक्ति को गोली मारी", "summary_hi": "इमिग्रेशन एंड कस्टम्स एन्फोर्समेंट (ICE) एजेंटों ने न्यूयॉर्क शहर में एक व्यक्ति को गोली मार दी, जबकि वाहन में एक 5 साल का बच्चा मौजूद था, ऐसा मेयर एरिक एडम्स ने कहा। यह घटना मार्बल हिल में हुई। मेयर ने कार्रवाई का वादा किया है और शहर से ICE को वापस बुलाने की मांग की है, यह कहते हुए \"हम उन्हें बाहर चाहते हैं।\" उन्होंने इस मामले को लेकर राष्ट्रपति ट्रम्प से भी संपर्क किया है। गोली लगने वाले व्यक्ति की पहचान ऑस्कर बेल्गल के रूप में बताई गई है।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized the presence of a 5-year-old child in the car during the ICE shooting."], "center": ["Highlighted Mayor Adams' call to remove ICE from New York City and his contact with President Trump.", "Focused on the identity of the man shot, Oscar Belgal, and provided details about him.", "Reported the shooting by ICE officers in New York City."], "right": ["Stressed Mayor Mamdani's condemnation of the ICE shooting and his demand for their removal."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["ICE गोलीबारी के दौरान कार में 5 साल के बच्चे की मौजूदगी पर जोर दिया।"], "center": ["मेयर एडम्स के न्यूयॉर्क शहर से ICE को हटाने के आह्वान और राष्ट्रपति ट्रम्प से संपर्क पर प्रकाश डाला।", "गोली लगने वाले व्यक्ति, ऑस्कर बेल्गल की पहचान पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया और उनके बारे में विवरण प्रदान किया।", "न्यूयॉर्क शहर में ICE अधिकारियों द्वारा गोलीबारी की सूचना दी।"], "right": ["मेयर मAMDANI द्वारा ICE गोलीबारी की निंदा और उन्हें हटाने की उनकी मांग पर जोर दिया।"]}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://s.france24.com/media/display/37d03862-c3a1-11f1-8aea-ef6152f87623/w:1024/p:16x9/8486a05cfb4b866ec0c054f68d6f50c81cd6e869.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Hindustan Times", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Who is Oscar Belgal? 5 things on New York City man shot by ICE agents in Marble Hill; Mayor Mamdani vows action | Hindustan Times"}, {"source": "The Telegraph (India)", "owner": "ABP Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "ICE agents shoot New York City man in car with 5-year-old child present, says mayor"}, {"source": "France 24", "owner": "France 24", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNaV9WNklYMFh5RERrWkgtR1JPTEV6SXF6ZHJtM0Q4X3B3Qm5TTEFYQ1p4ZUVRTmgwa2lKbzRxaVhwODIxWm9jNDFkMG9FdllFUXd1TmhvVzhUdHhycVczblVsOFpwYXFzbGlzSVA0Umx5Qk9lNUlOazJUU3dZc0JuWndoNHJMQ2JtdlllSjdRT2J6X291NXUzZkJkZzBkaHlhTXg2REdFclA0bm1kMlhz?oc=5", "headline": "New York mayor says asking Trump to withdraw ICE after shooting"}, {"source": "The Washington Post", "owner": "The Washington Post", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Family accuses ICE of ‘executing’ immigrant whose sons are now in foster care"}, {"source": "CNN", "owner": "CNN", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxQN05FSVRMQXhtc0dJNjgtWEhyZkNTYVpyVE9nT1R2UW1YQ0cyM3BtX1Q5Ri0xU2RTZmFxSEVPUGJVSUdtNThiOU51cHhmSVFtb3d5TDdZNTNVb3Fsb3RaOTMxdzB2elUyMjRTaWcteXFUQnBmejktZHR4LVRCZzg1Z0lkVHhScUVfQlZ2ZmRmczZfUTNjUXVBODV3dE5XU0dMV3B4VWdYVDZ4aTRLMkFHc05TS0xEeklTRjZkMnIzMWdQMTc0TnNVLTVGTQ?oc=5", "headline": "Person shot during encounter with federal agents, NYPD says"}, {"source": "Le Monde", "owner": "Le M